      },
      {
         "step": 2,
         "text": "Integrate each term, raising the power by 1 and dividing by the new power: \\( f(x) = C + \\frac{1}{3}x^{3} - \\frac{1}{6}x^{6} + \\frac{1}{9}x^{9} + \\cdots \\).",
